College, USA. Both were tested for the presentation theme 'Warsaw'. Please note
that these color themes are neither official nor exact! The colours are
approximated from the universities' style guidelines and websites, and slightly
modified where necessary to generate an appealing look. The universities
neither endorse, nor provide any support for, these color themes. I give no
