%description -n texlive-colorspace
The package provides PDF color spaces. Currently, only spot colors and
overprinting are supported. It requires xcolor, and supports pdfTeX and LuaTeX.

%package -n texlive-colortab
Summary:        Shade cells of tables and halign
Version:        svn22155
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
