%description -n texlive-colortab
The package lets you shade or colour the cells in the alignment environments
such as \halign and LaTeX's tabular and array environments. The colortbl
package is to be preferred today with LaTeX (it assures compatibility with the
longtable package, which is no longer true with colortab); another modern
option is the table-colouring option of the xcolor. However, colortab remains
an adequate solution for use with Plain TeX.

%package -n texlive-colorwav
Summary:        Colours by wavelength of visible light
Version:        svn67012
License:        LGPL-2.1-or-later
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
