%description -n texlive-commonunicode
The aim of this LaTeX package is to provide a complete as possible list of
common Unicode symbols with their translations to LaTeX code. This is useful in
the development of templates which are intended to work with modern TeX engines
(LuaTeX, XeTeX) as well as traditional ones (TeX, pdfTeX).

%package -n texlive-competences
Summary:        Track skills of classroom checks
Version:        svn47573
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
