This package is an attempt to track skills assessed during a classroom check.
Each question can be associated with one or more skills and be assigned a
number of points to be earned. At the end of the text, a table set summarizes
the skills assessed, and in what proportions.

%package -n texlive-concepts
Summary:        Keeping track of formal 'concepts' for a particular field
Version:        svn29020
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
