%description -n texlive-continue
This package provides for a variety of continuation indicators on pages when
the text continues on the following page. The default is to only mark odd
pages, but all pages can be marked and the marking can be stopped or started at
any point.

%package -n texlive-contour
Summary:        Print a coloured contour around text
Version:        svn77682
License:        LPPL-1.3c
