%package -n texlive-cooking-units
Summary:        Typeset and convert units for cookery books and recipes
Version:        svn76924
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea

%description -n texlive-cooking-units
The package provides commands to typeset amounts and units consistently and
offers an easy-to-use key-value syntax to convert one unit into another (for
