%description -n texlive-copyrightbox
The package command \copyrightbox[<placement>]{<image command>}{<text>}, which
places the text as a copyright notice relating to the matter created by the
image command.

%package -n texlive-coseoul
Summary:        Context sensitive outline elements
Version:        svn23862
License:        LPPL-1.3c
