Obsoletes:      texlive-counttexruns-doc <= 11:%{version}
Requires:       tex(kvoptions.sty)

%description -n texlive-counttexruns
The package counts how often a LaTeX document is compiled, keeping the data in
an external file. To print the count, can use the macro \thecounttexruns.

%package -n texlive-courseoutline
Summary:        Prepare university course outlines
Version:        svn15878
License:        LicenseRef-Fedora-UltraPermissive
