%description -n texlive-csvsimple
The package provides a simple LaTeX interface for the processing of files with
comma separated values (CSV); it relies on the key value syntax supported by
pgfkeys to simplify usage. Filtering and table generation are especially
supported; however, this lightweight tool offers no support for data sorting or
data base storage. The package depends on etoolbox, ifthen, pgfrcs, pgfkeys,
and shellesc.

%package -n texlive-cuisine
