the "Counting Words" program distributed with CWEB, edited to run with LaTeX.

%package -n texlive-cyber
Summary:        Annotate compliance with cybersecurity requirements
Version:        svn46776
License:        MIT
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-cyber-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-cyber-doc <= 11:%{version}
