In standard LaTeX inserting objects like figures or tables requires too much
knowledge for beginners and too much typing effort and hardcoding for people
like me. This package aims to make insertion of figures and tables easier for
both beginners and experts. Despite the term "floats" in its name, it also
allows to disable floating of such objects.

%package -n texlive-easyformat
Summary:        Easily add boldface, italics and smallcaps
