This package allows you to create lists of numbered items (as in Wittgenstein's
'Tractatus') with a single active character as the only command. A variety of
parameters are available to configure the appearance of the list; lists may be
nested (effectively to unlimited depth).

%package -n texlive-easyreview
Summary:        Package to provide a way to review (or perform editorial process) in LaTeX
Version:        svn38352
