%description -n texlive-easyreview
The easyReview package provides a way to review (or perform editorial process)
in LaTeX. You can use the provided commands to claim attention in different
ways to part of the text, or even to indicate that a text was added, needs to
be removed, needs to be replaced and add comments to the text.

%package -n texlive-ebezier
Summary:        Device independent picture environment enhancement
Version:        svn76924
