%description -n texlive-ebezier
Ebezier is a device independent extension for the standard picture environment.
Linear, quadratic, and cubic bezier curves are supplied in connection with
higher level circle drawing commands. Additionally some macros for the
calculation of curve lengths are part of this package.

%package -n texlive-ecclesiastic
Summary:        Typesetting Ecclesiastic Latin
Version:        svn38172
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
