%description -n texlive-ellipsis
This is a simple package that fixes a problem in the way LaTeX handles
ellipses: it always puts a tiny bit more space after \dots in text mode than
before it, which results in the ellipsis being off-center when used between two
words.

%package -n texlive-elmath
Summary:        Mathematics in Greek texts
