%description -n texlive-emo
Emo implements the \emo{'emoji-name'} command for including color emoji such as
[?] (\emo{desert-island}) or [?] (\emo{parrot}) in your documents independent
of input encoding or LaTeX engine. The implementation uses the Noto color emoji
