very similar. Emo may come in particularly handy when dealing with academic
publishers that provide only minimal support for non-Latin scripts.

%package -n texlive-emotion
Summary:        Make emojis more easy to use in XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
Version:        svn76924
License:        Apache-2.0
Requires:       texlive-base
