%description -n texlive-gmdoc
A LaTeX package and an example class for documenting (La)TeX packages, document
classes, .dtx etc., providing hyperlinks. The package is believed to be
compatible with doc and permits minimal markup of code (the macrocode
environment is no longer necessary). The package provides automatic detection
of definitions (detecting such things as \def, \newcommand, \DeclareOption
etc.). The package needs hyperref and the author's three 'basic' packages:
gmutils, gmverb and gmiflink. As a bonus (and as an example of doc
compatibility) driver files are provided that may be used to typeset the LaTeX
Base.

%package -n texlive-gmdoc-enhance
Summary:        Some enhancements to the gmdoc package
Version:        svn15878
License:        LPPL-1.3c
