Requires:       tex(gmdoc.sty)

%description -n texlive-gmdoc-enhance
This package provides some enhancements for the gmdoc package: nicer formatting
for multiple line inline comments, an ability to "comment out" some code, and a
macro to input other files in "normal" LaTeX mode.

%package -n texlive-gmiflink
Summary:        Simplify usage of \hypertarget and \hyperlink
Version:        svn15878
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
