Requires:       tex(xltxtra.sty)

%description -n texlive-gmutils
Miscellaneous macros used by others of the author's packages. Contents of the
package: \newgif and other globals; \@ifnextcat and \@ifXeTeX;
\(Re)storeMacro(s) to override redefinitions; \afterfi and friends; commands
from relsize, etc.; "almost an environment" or redefinition of \begin (\begin*
doesn't check if the argument environment is defined).

%package -n texlive-gmverb
Summary:        A variant of LaTeX \verb, verbatim and shortvrb
Version:        svn24288
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
