%description -n texlive-gmverb
A redefinition of \verb and verbatim so that long lines are breakable before \
and after { with % as 'hyphen'. Allows you to define your own verbatim-like
environments (subject to a size limit) and allows you to declare any single
character as a shorthand as in the \MakeShortVerb command of the shortvrb
package of the LaTeX distribution. The package depends on the gmutils package.

