Requires:       texlive-kpathsea

%description -n texlive-gradient-text
This package enables writers to conveniently decorate text with linear gradient
colors. The RGB values of the first and the last character are specified as
parameters while the rest of the text is colored automatically.

%package -n texlive-grading-scheme
Summary:        Typeset grading schemes in tabular format
Version:        svn76924
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
