%description -n texlive-hvpygmentex
The package is based on pygmentex but provides an automatic run from within the
document itself, with the option --shell-escape. It does not need the
additional action by the user to run the external program pygmentize to create
the code snippets.

%package -n texlive-hvqrurl
Summary:        Insert a QR code in the margin
Version:        svn71361
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
