Requires:       tex(xkeyval.sty)

%description -n texlive-hvqrurl
This package allows to draw an URL as a QR code into the margin of a one- or
twosided document. The following packages are loaded by default: qrcode,
marginnote, url, xcolor and xkeyval.

%package -n texlive-hwemoji
Summary:        Unicode emoji support for pdfLaTeX with sequences
Version:        svn65001
License:        LPPL-1.3c AND CC-BY-4.0
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Requires:       tex(ifnextok.sty)
Requires:       tex(scalerel.sty)

%description -n texlive-hwemoji
This package provides direct support for Unicode emoji in pdfLaTeX, with full
access to emoji sequences including but not limited to flag sequences,
diversity modifier sequences, and tag sequences. Emojis are displayed through
Twemoji digital assets, as licensed under the CC-BY 4.0.

%package -n texlive-hypdestopt
Summary:        Hyperref destination optimizer
Version:        svn77682
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
