Requires:       tex(longtable.sty)
Requires:       tex(siunitx.sty)
Requires:       tex(translations.sty)
Requires:       tex(xcolor.sty)
Requires:       tex(xparse.sty)

%description -n texlive-invoice2
Typeset invoices with automatic VAT and calculation of totals. Supports
internationalization, invoices are typeset with booktabs for readability. Does
not support separate projects per invoice. Can be used as a replacement for
invoice in most cases.

%package -n texlive-ipsum
Summary:        Insert multilingual placeholder text
Version:        svn75788
License:        LPPL-1.3c
