The package provides lightweight and robust facilities for creating and
managing keys. Its machinery isn't as extensive as that of, e.g., the ltxkeys
package, but it is equally robust; ease of use and speed of processing are the
design aims of the package.

%package -n texlive-keyvaltable
Summary:        Re-usable table layouts separating content and presentation
Version:        svn77682
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
