Implements KIX codes as used by the Dutch PTT for bulk mail addressing. (Royal
Mail 4 State Code.) KIX is a registered trade mark of PTT Post Holdings B. V.

%package -n texlive-knowledge
Summary:        Displaying, hyperlinking, and indexing notions in a document
Version:        svn78576
License:        LPPL-1.3c
