%description -n texlive-koma-moderncvclassic
This package provides an imitation of the moderncv class with the classic style
(by Xavier Danaux), to be used in conjunction with the KOMA-classes. Thus it is
possible to configure pagelayout, headings etc. the way it is done in
KOMA-classes. Moreover, it is possible to use BibLaTeX, while the original
moderncv-class is incompatible with BibLaTeX.

%package -n texlive-koma-script-sfs
Summary:        KOMA-Script letter class option for Finnish
Version:        svn77050
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
