%package -n texlive-labelschanged
Summary:        Identify labels which cause endless "may have changed" warnings
Version:        svn77682
License:        LicenseRef-Fedora-Public-Domain
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea

%description -n texlive-labelschanged
Several conditions can cause LaTeX labels to keep changing, no matter how many
times a document is recompiled. This package helps diagnose the cause of
repeated "Label(s) may have changed" warnings. The names and before/after
definitions of changing labels are printed at the end of each compile.
Multiply-defined labels are printed as well.

%package -n texlive-lambdax
