This package defines macros which are useful for many documents. It is a large
collection of simple 'little helpers' which do not really warrant a separate
package on their own. Included are, among other things, definitions of common
units with preceding thinspaces, framed boxes where both width and height can
be specified, starting new odd or even pages, draft markers, notes, conditional
includes, including EPS files, and versions of enumerate and itemize which
allow the horizontal and vertical spacing to be changed.

%package -n texlive-libgreek
Summary:        Greek letters in math mode from Libertinus or Linux Libertine/Biolinum
Version:        svn75712
