Requires:       tex(tcolorbox.sty)

%description -n texlive-minted-code
With package minted one can typeset LaTeX code with unicode characters. This
package minted-code defines several environments to simplify the application.

%package -n texlive-minutes
Summary:        Typeset the minutes of meetings
Version:        svn42186
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-minutes-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-minutes-doc <= 11:%{version}
