%description -n texlive-minutes
Supports the creation of a collection of minutes. Features include: Support of
tasks (who, schedule, what, time of finishing; possibility of creating a list
of open tasks; inclusion of open tasks from other minutes; Support for
attachments; Support of schedule dates (in planning: support for the calendar
package); Different versions ('secret parts'); and Macros for votes and
decisions (list of decisions). Support for minutes in German, Dutch and English
is provided.

%package -n texlive-mla-paper
Summary:        Proper MLA formatting
Version:        svn54080
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
