diagrams are designed to fit into Curriculum Vitae documents written using the
moderncv class.

%package -n texlive-modref
Summary:        Customisation of cross-references in LaTeX
Version:        svn15878
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-modref-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-modref-doc <= 11:%{version}
