%description -n texlive-neoschool
This package provides secondary school teachers with a comprehensive set of
tools for creating educational documents such as assessments, course materials,
exercise sheets with solutions, and more. It includes eight predefined color
themes, various class options for layout and typography, specialized
environments, dedicated commands, and multiple preformatted header styles
tailored to different document types. The package integrates numerous commonly
used LaTeX packages, which significantly reduces the need for extensive
preambles and minimizes compatibility issues. Additionally, it is multilingual,
supporting French, English, and German.

%package -n texlive-nestquot
