%description -n texlive-nfssext-cfr
The package is a development of nfssext.sty, distributed with the examples for
the font installation guide. The package has been developed for use in packages
such as cfr-lm and venturisadf,

%package -n texlive-nicefilelist
Summary:        Provide \listfiles alignment
Version:        svn77682
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-nicefilelist-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
