parenthesis-delimited expressions in math mode which also allows for an easier
switching of brace sizes. For example, the syntax " `\big( a + b ) " can be
used to replace "\bigl( a + b \bigr)".

%package -n texlive-phfqit
Summary:        Macros for typesetting Quantum Information Theory
Version:        svn60734
License:        LPPL-1.3c
