%description -n texlive-phfquotetext
This package provides an environment for displaying block text with special
characters, such as verbatim quotes from a referee report which may contain
pseudo-(La)TeX code. This behaves like a verbatim environment, except that it
displays its content as normal paragraph content, ignoring any white space
preformatting.

%package -n texlive-phfsvnwatermark
