This is the public release of the qstest bundle (written for DocScape
Publisher) (C) 2006, 2007 QuinScape GmbH. The bundle contains the packages
'makematch' for matching patterns to targets (with a generalization in the form
of pattern lists and keyword lists), and 'qstest' for performing unit tests,
allowing the user to run a number of logged tests ensuring the consistency of
values, properties and call sequences during execution of test code. Both
packages make extensive use of in their package documentation, providing
illustrated examples that are automatically verified to work as expected. Check
the README file for details.

%package -n texlive-qsymbols
Summary:        Maths symbol abbreviations
Version:        svn15878
