The primary function of this package is to replicate a common feature found in
many integrated development environments (IDEs), wherein matching parentheses
at the same nesting level are assigned corresponding colors. This visual aid
facilitates improved readability and cognitive parsing of complex expressions.

%package -n texlive-ran_toks
