This package (like luarandom, but without the obligation to use LuaLaTeX)
provides some macros for creating random integer number lists between a and b.
This list can have multiple numbers or not, and this list can be sorted or not.

%package -n texlive-randtext
Summary:        Randomise the order of characters in strings
Version:        svn15878
License:        LPPL-1.3c
