%description -n texlive-readablecv
This class provides, what I have found, to be an extremely attractive and
highly readable CV which will lead to your CV being read rather than
disregarded.

%package -n texlive-readarray
Summary:        Read, store and recall array-formatted data
Version:        svn60540
