%description -n texlive-recipecard
The recipecard class typesets recipes into note card sized boxes that can then
be cut out and pasted on to note cards. The recipe then looks elegant and fits
in the box of recipes.

%package -n texlive-rectopma
Summary:        Recycle top matter
