long name, which can be referenced later with the name or just the short form.
For instance, "Milestone M1: Specification created" can be defined and later on
be referenced with 'M1' or 'M1 ("Specification created")'. The text in the
references is derived from the definition and also rendered as hyperlink to the
definition.

%package -n texlive-reflectgraphics
Summary:        Techniques for reflecting graphics
Version:        svn40612
