The repltext package exposes to LaTeX a relatively obscure PDF feature:
replacement text. When replacement text is specified for a piece of text, it is
the replacement text, not the typeset text that is copied and pasted.

%package -n texlive-rescansync
Summary:        Re-scan tokens with synctex information
Version:        svn76924
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
