providing multilingual features to a LaTeX package. The package has its own
basic dictionaries for English, Brazilian, Catalan, Dutch, French, German and
Spanish; it aims to use translation material for English, Dutch, French,
German, Italian, Spanish, Catalan, Turkish, Croatian, Hungarian, Danish and
Portuguese from babel or polyglossia if either is in use in the document.
(Additional languages from the multilingual packages may be possible: ask the
author.)

%package -n texlive-transparent
