%description -n texlive-xpatch
The package generalises the macro patching commands provided by Philipp
Lehmann's etoolbox.

%package -n texlive-xpeek
Summary:        Define commands that peek ahead in the input stream
Version:        svn61719
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-xpeek-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
