%description -n texlive-xpeek
The package provides tools to help define commands that, like \xspace and the
LaTeX command \textit, peek at what follows them in the command stream and
choose appropriate behaviour.

%package -n texlive-xpeekahead
Summary:        A simple way for peeking ahead after commands and environments
Version:        svn77050
License:        LPPL-1.3c OR AGPL-3.0-or-later
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea

%description -n texlive-xpeekahead
This package offers a few commands aiming at peeking ahead after environments
and commands in simple cases.

%package -n texlive-xprintlen
Summary:        Print TeX lengths in a variety of units
Version:        svn35928
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
